WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.264
Nder gariiri ndin, laawol ɗon ƴiwo nder ladde, ɗon hoola dow ladde ladde.

00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:09.583
Ɗuum waɗi ndiyam ɓerɗe nder ɓolde, o waɗi ndiyam duumiiɗam.

00:00:09.663 --> 00:00:14.196
Yimɓe mawɓe mbi'aay en njahaay ton bana ndeen njahaama to kasu.

00:00:14.276 --> 00:00:17.490
On ɗon yaha nder nokkuure nde'e bee hakkiilo.
